# BlazBlue Centralfiction - MUA Format

## Overview

The `.MUA` format stores:

- Skeletons
- Bones
- Meshes
- Materials
- Vertex Buffers
- Face Buffers
- Strings
- Default Animations

Optional animations are stored in `.MMOT` files.

