## Vertex Layout

| Offset | Type | Description |
|--------:|------|-------------|
| 0x00 | float3 | Position |
| 0x0C | int3 | Normal |
| 0x18 | int3 | Tangent |
| 0x24 | float2 | UV |
| 0x34 | RGBA8 | Vertex Color |
| 0x38 | float3 | Bone Indices |
| 0x44 | float3 | Bone Weights |

Stride: **0x50 (80 bytes)**

